{"firma": "04963bddbf477b07b7d564b83368c7e32d737487", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 106244, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「近衛兵、何をしている。奴をとらえよ！」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「近衛兵、何をしている。奴をとらえよ！」\"", "en": "Guards, what are you doing?! Arrest this person!", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"Guards, what are you doing?! Arrest this person!\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Guardie del corpo, che fate? Catturatelo!"}
